      "solution": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>33.33% of&nbsp; 7056 &ndash; {(63 &times; 2) /<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{196}\\)</span>} &ndash; 15% of (80/3)&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{3}\\)</span>&nbsp;&times; 7056 -&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{126}{14}\\)</span>&nbsp;- (15&nbsp;&divide; 100)(80 &divide; 3)</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{3}\\)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;&times; 7056 -&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{126}{14}\\)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;- (15&nbsp;&divide; 100)(80 &divide; 3)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 2352 - 9 - 4</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 2352 - 13 = 2339</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The correct answer is 2339.</strong></p>\n",
