      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">11</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{9}\\)</span><span style=\"\">% of 9</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{11}\\)</span><span style=\"\">% of&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">7</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{7}\\)</span><span style=\"\">% of 6</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{4}\\)</span><span style=\"\">% of 11088</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><strong>Concept used:</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Some conversions:</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">11</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{9}\\)</span><span style=\"\">% =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{9}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">9</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{11}\\)</span><span style=\"\">% =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{11}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">7</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{7}\\)</span><span style=\"\">% =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{14}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&nbsp;6</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{4}\\)</span><span style=\"\">% =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{16}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><strong>Calculation:</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">11</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{9}\\)</span><span style=\"\">% of 9</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{11}\\)</span><span style=\"\">% of&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">7</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{7}\\)</span><span style=\"\">% of 6</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{4}\\)</span><span style=\"\">% of 11088&nbsp;= ?</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">The above expression can be written as:</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;? =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{9}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;of&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{11}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;of&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{14}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;of&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{16}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;of 11088</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;? =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{9}\\)</span>&nbsp;of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{11}\\)</span>&nbsp;of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{14}\\)</span>&nbsp;of 693</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;? =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{9}\\)</span>&nbsp;of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{11}\\)</span>&nbsp;of&nbsp;49.5</p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;? =&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{9}\\)</span>&nbsp;of&nbsp;4.5</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; ? = 0.5</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The value of the required answer is 0.5.</strong></p>\n",
