          "id": "D",
          "text": "364",
          "html": "364"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">104% of&nbsp;200 + 46% of 350 + 64% of 550 - 56% of 650 = ?</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><strong>Concept used:</strong></span></p>\n\n<p>Follow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/08/image%20%282%29.png\" style=\" width: 350px; height: 196px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">Calculation:</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">104% of&nbsp;200 + 46% of 350 + 64% of 550 - 56% of 650 = ?</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Let the unknown number be x.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">104% of&nbsp;200 + 46% of 350 + 64% of 550 - 56% of 650 = x</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{104}{100}\\)</span>&nbsp;&times; 200 +&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{46}{100}\\)</span>&nbsp;&times; 350 +&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{64}{100}\\)</span>&nbsp;&times; 550&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{56}{100}\\)</span>&nbsp;&times; 650 = x</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 208 + 161 + 352 - 364 = ?</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; x = 721 - 364 = 357</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">104% of&nbsp;200 + 46% of 350 + 64% of 550 - 56% of 650 = 357.</span></strong></p>\n",
