        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "65.7",
          "html": "65.7"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Let's assume that the number is k</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">According to the question, ⇒ <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{2}{3}\\)</span>k = 84 ⇒ k = 84 × <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{3}{2}\\)</span> = 126</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Then 45% of 126 is = 126 × 45/100 = 56.7</p>\n",
