    {
      "id": "46ad58b97f16-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "If 20% of 30% of the 3600 = 10% of x, then what is the value of x?",
      "questionHtml": "If 20% of 30% of the 3600 = 10% of x, then what is the value of x?&nbsp;",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2500",
          "html": "2500"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "2160",
          "html": "2160"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2450",
          "html": "2450"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "2675",
          "html": "2675"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">20% of 30% of the 3600 = 10% of x</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">Formula used:</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">x% of y</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">= (x / 100)&nbsp;</span><span style=\" line-height: 107%;  background: white;\">&times;&nbsp;</span>y</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Solving using above formula,</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">20% of 30% of the 3600 = 10% of x</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{20}{100} \\times \\dfrac{30}{100} \\times 3600 = \\dfrac{10}{100} \\times x\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>216 = x / 10</p>\n\n<p>x = 216&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&times; 10</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">x = 2160</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">The value of x is 2160.</span></strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "46ad58b97f16-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "What is the value of 32 percent of 75 percent of 7800?",
      "questionHtml": "What is the value of 32 percent of 75 percent of 7800?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1952",
          "html": "1952"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1850",
          "html": "1850"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2042",
          "html": "2042"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1872",
          "html": "1872"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The number is = 7800</p>\n\n<p><strong>Concept:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(X\\%={X\\over100}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>According to the question</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 32% of 75% of 7800</p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\({32\\over100} \\times {75\\over100}\\times 7800\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\({32\\over4}\\times 3\\times 78=8\\times 3\\times 78=24\\times 78=1872\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The required result will be 1872.</strong></p>\n",
